*User Story:*

As a As a Production Accounting data owner,

I want to see only tables that make sense, and that I understand and have approved,

So that Production Accounting data consumers can easily be directed to the data they need.



*Acceptance Criteria:*

The current “gold_tips” and “gold_tips_reference” schemas are cleaned up as per the below table that specifies what action should taken for each table in the schema:

