{adf}

Facility Balance Report for Marketing & BD that shows previous balance for the last two months.  These additional tables are required for ingestion to meet the data requirements: 

|INVENTORY|
|INVENTORY_SEGREGATION|
|INVENTORY_BALANCE_QTY|

In addition to creating this report in Databricks, there is *a requirement to retain historical data for the last 14 months starting Sept 2024.* 

Refer to Facility Balance - Logistics spreadsheet for Epic Questionnaire answers. 

Refer to attached eONE Tables & Keys spreadsheet for detailed table requirements. 

Metadata template is currently being populated by Melody. 



{color:#bf2600}+*Acceptance Criteria: (ie/ as an end user, I consider the epic complete when…)*+{color}

# {color:#bf2600}We have full access to historical data going back to September 2024.{color}

# {color:#bf2600}Quality metrics are accurate by owner, counterparty, and location. These will be validated with the rail and truck teams once the data is complete.{color}

# {color:#bf2600}Power BI is successfully connected to the data source.{color}

# {color:#bf2600}Data is refreshed daily (with a one-day lag) and is available by 10 AM each day.{color}

{color:#bf2600} {color}
